# Mini Search Engine

A C++ search engine that builds an inverted index from text documents and supports efficient keyword search.

## Features

- Inverted Index
- Fast keyword lookup
- Case-insensitive search
- Text preprocessing
- File system traversal

## Tech Stack

- C++17
- STL
- Filesystem
- Hash Tables

